---
import Section from './Section.astro';
---

<Section id="about" title="About">
  <div class="space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-700 dark:text-stone-300">
    <p>
      I'm a builder at heart. For three years I was a FullStack &amp; Platform Engineer on Amazon's
      AWS Security data platform team, building ingestion pipelines that crunch
      <strong class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-stone-100">11+ PB/day</strong>
      of security telemetry, plus the internal tooling analysts use to run massive SQL jobs and
      sweep away petabytes of stale data with a single API call.
    </p>
    <p>
      Before Amazon I did AI research with MIT, Cal State, and Kean University, and freelanced
      full-stack work my way through a CS degree.
    </p>
    <p>
      Now I'm based in Austin and heads-down building. My latest is
      <a href="#projects" class="font-medium text-[var(--accent)] hover:text-[var(--accent-strong)]">Kanban Gamify</a>,
      a Chrome extension that makes working your way through a kanban board feel responsive, fun,
      and rewarding, with confetti, chimes, and streak tracking every time you ship a task. I'm
      also
      <a href="#projects" class="font-medium text-[var(--accent)] hover:text-[var(--accent-strong)]">gamifying the Claude desktop app</a>
      and turning a handful of other apps into a business.
      Making work more fun is a problem I'm happy to keep solving.
    </p>
  </div>
</Section>
